     purposes, or for learning, evaluation, research, or non-profit
     purposes.
   - Commercial Use: use by a for-profit company, corporation,
     institution, or organization as part of its business or
     revenue-generating activities. Use in the course of a business is
     Commercial Use regardless of organization size (number of
     employees, revenue, etc.).

2. Use (Currently Free)
   The Software may currently be installed and used free of charge for
   both Personal / Non-Commercial Use and Commercial Use. No license key
   or payment is required. Voluntary donations are welcome but optional;
   no functionality is gated on donation status.

3. Future Versions
   This Agreement applies to this release (this version). The Licensor
   reserves the right to distribute future versions under different terms,
   including a paid commercial license for Commercial Use. Any such change
   applies only to future versions and does not affect the free-use rights
   this Agreement grants for a version the User has already received.

4. Permitted
   - Install and use on any number of machines.
   - Redistribute the original, unmodified installer or binary, provided
     this notice and the accompanying THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES are included
     (no resale or distribution for a fee).

5. Not Permitted
   - Reverse engineer, decompile, or disassemble the Software, or
     attempt to extract source code, except to the extent expressly
     permitted by applicable law.
   - Modify, repackage, or rebrand the binary for redistribution.
   - Resell, rent, lease, sublicense, or provide the Software to third
     parties for a fee.
   - Remove or alter copyright, trademark, or other proprietary notices.
   - Circumvent or disable any license or security mechanism.

6. Ownership
   The Software and all intellectual property rights therein remain the
   property of the Licensor. This Agreement grants a license to use only
   and does not transfer ownership.

7. Third-Party Components
   The Software includes open-source and third-party components subject
   to their own licenses, listed in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES and the in-app
   "View Licenses" screen. Those licenses govern their components.

8. Disclaimer of Warranty
   THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND,
   EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO MERCHANTABILITY,
   FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, AND NON-INFRINGEMENT.

9. Limitation of Liability
   TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY APPLICABLE LAW, THE LICENSOR SHALL
   NOT BE LIABLE FOR ANY DIRECT, INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, OR
   CONSEQUENTIAL DAMAGES (INCLUDING LOSS OF DATA OR BUSINESS
